# mm.shell test target

Covers the target-safe mm.shell foundation: CapabilitySet bitset operations,
standard capability profiles, name lookup, static CommandDescriptor Registry
lifecycle and duplicate rejection, IoServices memory sink buffering, and
preflight scratch overflow protection in CommandContext, the embedded scanner
and measured parser, transactional state pools with positional call frames,
signed arithmetic, and case pattern matching, field splitting, parameter
resolution, word expansion, monotonic function storage with adopted handles,
and the cooperative evaluator's simple-command dispatch, assignment semantics,
conditionals, loops, case selection, brace groups, control-flow ownership,
output staging, instrumented operation units, argv capacity bounds, bounded
transaction scratch, set -e tested contexts against set -u, function
definition, resolution order, call frames, return ownership and recursion
bounds, script library installation, atomic packs and arena preflight, direct
and run invocation with capability gating, command substitution capture,
trimming, child isolation and refusals, atomic install_level1 admission, the
core builtin pack's descriptor classes, output, test operators, option
transactions, flow values, and introspection, and Session line accumulation,
multiline continuation, editing bytes, malformed and overlong recovery, and
drain ordering against a blocking transport.
